{"seq":1,"slug":"admission-controller-policy-design","title":"准入控制器与镜像策略建模（Kyverno/Gatekeeper）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/container-image-supply-chain-security-sbom-sigstore-slsa/admission-policy-enforcement/admission-controller-policy-design","wordCount":1892,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"准入控制器与镜像策略建模-kyverno-gatekeeper\">准入控制器与镜像策略建模（Kyverno/Gatekeeper）</h1><p>签名和溯源证明只是「可被验证的事实」——它们躺在 registry 里，不会自己挡住任何一次 <code>kubectl apply</code>。让供应链契约真正生效的那一环是 <strong>admission controller</strong>：集群在对象落盘 etcd 之前调用它，它要么放行，要么拒绝。这一环的建模质量决定了整条供应链安全的实际下限——一份只写了「禁止 <code>latest</code> 标签」的策略，和一份要求「镜像 manifest digest 必须带 SLSA Build L3 且构建源码为指定仓库」的策略，防住的是完全不同的攻击者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-策略是-可执行契约-不是检查清单\">核心概念：策略是「可执行契约」，不是检查清单</h2><p>准入策略的本质是把「我认为集群里应该跑什么」翻译成一段每次 API 写入都必然执行的判定逻辑。这带来三个建模约束。第一，它必须<strong>声明式且收敛</strong>——策略描述期望状态，而不是执行一组命令；同一个策略在任意时间点对同一对象必须给出同一结论。第二，它必须<strong>在唯一的咽喉点生效</strong>——Kubernetes 早期尝试过 mutating 与 validating 两阶段，mutating 先跑（可改写对象），validating 后跑（只能拒绝），Initializers 机制已被废弃，今天所有强制点都收敛到 webhook 与内置 CEL 两条通道。第三，它必须<strong>与产物事实解耦</strong>——策略不该内嵌镜像摘要，而是引用可被独立验证的 attestation（见 <a href=\"../signing-sigstore-slsa/slsa-provenance-build-integrity\">../3_signing-sigstore-slsa/2_slsa-provenance-build-integrity.md</a>），否则每次发布都要改策略，策略就退化成手工审批。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Deployment / Pod 对象] --&gt; B[MutatingAdmissionPolicy&lt;br/&gt;内置 CEL, beta 1.32]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Mutating webhook&lt;br/&gt;digest 钉扎 / 镜像重写]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Validating 阶段]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[ValidatingAdmissionPolicy&lt;br/&gt;内置 CEL, GA 1.30]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Gatekeeper&lt;br/&gt;Rego ConstraintTemplate]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Kyverno&lt;br/&gt;verifyImages / validate]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Sigstore Policy Controller&lt;br/&gt;ClusterImagePolicy]&#10;    G --&gt; I[cosign / notation 验证&lt;br/&gt;Fulcio + Rekor]&#10;    F --&gt; J[external data provider&lt;br/&gt;Ratify / Trivy]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; K[admissionResponse&lt;br/&gt;Deny → 请求被拒]&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    E --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[Deployment / Pod 对象] --&gt; B[MutatingAdmissionPolicy&lt;br/&gt;内置 CEL, beta 1.32]\n    A --&gt; C[Mutating webhook&lt;br/&gt;digest 钉扎 / 镜像重写]\n    B --&gt; D[Validating 阶段]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[ValidatingAdmissionPolicy&lt;br/&gt;内置 CEL, GA 1.30]\n    D --&gt; F[Gatekeeper&lt;br/&gt;Rego ConstraintTemplate]\n    D --&gt; G[Kyverno&lt;br/&gt;verifyImages / validate]\n    D --&gt; H[Sigstore Policy Controller&lt;br/&gt;ClusterImagePolicy]\n    G --&gt; I[cosign / notation 验证&lt;br/&gt;Fulcio + Rekor]\n    F --&gt; J[external data provider&lt;br/&gt;Ratify / Trivy]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; K[admissionResponse&lt;br/&gt;Deny → 请求被拒]\n    J --&gt; K\n    E --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"选型-四类实现的能力边界\">选型：四类实现的能力边界</h2><p>自建 Rego 与开箱即用的镜像验证是两条不同的路。Kyverno 走 Kubernetes 原生路线——策略就是 YAML，用 JMESPath 而非 Rego 做数据提取，<code>verifyImages</code> 规则把 cosign/notation 验证直接内建在引擎里，无需外部数据提供者。Gatekeeper 走 OPA 路线——<code>ConstraintTemplate</code> 定义通用逻辑（<code>Rego</code>），<code>Constraint</code> 实例化参数，镜像验证必须借助 <code>externalData</code> 把结果喂回 Rego，或者把验证前置到 CI。二者不是替代关系：Gatekeeper 的强项是任意资源的复杂约束与策略复用，Kyverno 的强项是镜像/attestation 语义开箱即用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>语言/机制</th>\n<th>镜像与 attestation 验证</th>\n<th>显著约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</td>\n<td>内置 CEL（K8s ≥1.30 GA）</td>\n<td>无原生支持，只能看对象字段</td>\n<td>无外部调用；CEL 有 cost budget，复杂逻辑会报 estimated cost exceeds budget</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gatekeeper</td>\n<td>Rego + ConstraintTemplate/Constraint</td>\n<td>需 externalData provider（如 Ratify）</td>\n<td>Rego 曲线陡；外部调用引入超时与缓存问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kyverno</td>\n<td>YAML + JMESPath，CVE 内建 verifyImages</td>\n<td>原生 cosign/keyless/notation + in-toto attestation</td>\n<td>验证在 webhook 内同步执行，registry/Rekor 慢会拖慢准入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sigstore Policy Controller</td>\n<td>ClusterImagePolicy</td>\n<td>专注签名与 attestation</td>\n<td>只做签名面，不做通用资源校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratify</td>\n<td>独立验证服务，可作 Gatekeeper provider</td>\n<td>SBOM / 签名 / SLSA 溯源多 verifier 插件</td>\n<td>需部署与 registry store 配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的判断标准是<strong>你要验证的是「对象长什么样」还是「产物是谁产的」</strong>。前者用内置 CEL 就够，后者必须有能访问 registry 与透明日志的引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略阶梯-从标签规范到溯源强制\">策略阶梯：从标签规范到溯源强制</h2><p>镜像策略的严格程度是一条可量化的阶梯，每上一级都关闭一类绕过路径：禁止可变标签 → 要求 digest 钉扎 → 要求签名存在 → 要求签名来自指定 OIDC 身份 → 要求 attestation 谓词成立 → 要求 SLSA 等级达标。前三级防的是「拉错了东西」，后三级防的是「拉对了东西但是别人伪造的」。</p>\n<p>Kyverno 的建模把这条阶梯压进一个 <code>verifyImages</code> 规则里：<code>imageReferences</code> 划定作用域，<code>attestors</code> 描述信任根，<code>attestations</code> 用 <code>predicateType</code> 加 JMESPath <code>conditions</code> 表达「谓词内必须成立的事实」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: verify-image-provenance&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: check-slsa-and-sbom&#10;      match:&#10;        any: [{resources: {kinds: [Pod]}}]&#10;      verifyImages:&#10;        - imageReferences: [&quot;registry.example.com/*&quot;]&#10;          attestors:&#10;            - entries:&#10;                - keyless:&#10;                    subject: &quot;https://github.com/example/app/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main&quot;&#10;                    issuer: &quot;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&quot;&#10;                    rekor:&#10;                      url: &quot;https://rekor.sigstore.dev&quot;&#10;          attestations:&#10;            - predicateType: https://slsa.dev/provenance/v1&#10;              conditions:&#10;                - all:&#10;                    - key: &quot;{{ builder.id }}&quot;&#10;                      operator: Equals&#10;                      value: &quot;https://github.com/example/build-platform&quot;&#10;            - predicateType: https://spdx.dev/Document\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">verify-image-provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validationFailureAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Enforce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">check-slsa-and-sbom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]}}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      verifyImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">imageReferences</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"registry.example.com/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          attestors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">keyless</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/example/app/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    issuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    rekor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://rekor.sigstore.dev\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          attestations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">predicateType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://slsa.dev/provenance/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{{ builder.id }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      operator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Equals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                      value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/example/build-platform\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">predicateType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://spdx.dev/Document</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计点是 <code>subject</code>/<code>issuer</code> 这一对：keyless 模式下没有长期密钥，身份就是 OIDC 主体。只校验「签名有效」等于没校验——任何人都能用自己 GitHub Actions 的身份签一个镜像再推上来。<strong>信任必须绑到身份，而不是绑到「有没有证书」。</strong></p>\n<p>Gatekeeper 侧等价逻辑走 <code>externalData</code>：Rego 里 <code>data.external.ratify</code> 拿到验证结果，再在 <code>violation</code> 里判断。两者的运维差异在于，Kyverno 的失败信息由引擎生成，Gatekeeper 需要自己在 Rego 里写 <code>msg</code>，可读性直接决定了工程师排查准入拒绝的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效模式-策略-装了-为什么没生效\">失效模式：策略「装了」为什么没生效</h2><p>准入策略最常见的失败不是写错，而是<strong>被绕过</strong>。设某集群共有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条创建 Pod 的路径，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 条未被任何 Enforce 策略覆盖，则有效强制覆盖率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = 1 - \\frac{U}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四类系统性漏洞会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 悄悄变大。<strong>其一，<code>failurePolicy: Ignore</code></strong>——webhook 不可达时默认放行，一次网络抖动就等于一次全量绕过；正确做法是 <code>Fail</code> 并对 webhook 自身做高可用，代价是控制面故障会阻塞所有部署。<strong>其二，<code>namespaceSelector</code> 排除</strong>——为 <code>kube-system</code> 排除是合理的，但排除清单一旦缺乏审计就会持续膨胀。<strong>其三，Audit/dryrun 长期不收敛</strong>——策略以 <code>validationFailureAction: Audit</code> 或 Gatekeeper <code>enforcementAction: dryrun</code> 上线后无人推动到 Enforce，等于没有强制。<strong>其四，验证范围与拉取范围不一致</strong>——策略只匹配 <code>Pod</code>，但工作负载由 Deployment→ReplicaSet 生成，若 webhook 的 <code>objectSelector</code> 或 <code>match</code> 未覆盖实际创建路径就会出现空窗。这些漏洞的共同点是：<strong>它们不产生告警，只在攻击发生时表现为「策略明明有」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"运营-灰度-例外与策略即代码\">运营：灰度、例外与策略即代码</h2><p>策略从 Audit 到 Enforce 之间必须有一段<strong>基于真实数据</strong>的灰度期：先以 Audit 跑满一个部署周期，统计违规对象清单，修完存量再切 Enforce。例外治理要有明确的、带过期语义的机制而不是改策略——Kyverno 提供 <code>PolicyException</code> CRD（引用被豁免的策略名、命名空间隔离、可设 <code>expiresAt</code>），Gatekeeper 侧通常用 <code>match.excludedNamespaces</code> 或把豁免提升为受审的 <code>Constraint</code> 参数。</p>\n<p>策略本身要进版本控制并接受测试：Kyverno 提供 <code>kyverno test</code> 对策略做给定输入的断言测试，Gatekeeper 提供 <code>gator</code> 做同样的事。这两者把「策略改了会不会误伤存量」从人工评审变成 CI 门禁。此外要监控两个准入侧 SLI：webhook 的 <strong>P99 延迟</strong>（验证要访问 registry 与 Rekor，网络慢会直接拖慢全集群部署）与 <strong>拒绝率突变</strong>（拒绝率骤升往往意味着 registry 或 Fulcio 不可达，而非真的有人推了坏镜像——区分「策略生效」与「验证依赖故障」是排障的第一分叉）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>准入控制器是把供应链事实转化为集群强制的唯一咽喉点，其建模质量而非签名本身决定了安全下限。选型上，判断标准是「验证对象字段」还是「验证产物来源」——前者用内置 CEL，后者需要 Kyverno/Gatekeeper 这类能访问 registry 与透明日志的引擎。策略建模应沿「标签规范→digest 钉扎→签名→身份→attestation 谓词→SLSA 等级」的阶梯逐级收紧，其中绑定 OIDC 身份而非仅校验签名有效是关键分水岭。最需要警惕的是覆盖率幻觉：<code>failurePolicy: Ignore</code>、命名空间排除膨胀、长期 Audit 不收敛与 match 范围错配这四类漏洞都不产生告警，却让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远低于表面值。运营上以 Audit 灰度、以 <code>PolicyException</code> 做带过期的例外、以 <code>kyverno test</code>/<code>gator</code> 把策略纳入 CI，并同时监控准入延迟与拒绝率突变，才能让策略从配置文件变成真正的控制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"准入控制器与镜像策略建模（Kyverno/Gatekeeper）","id":"准入控制器与镜像策略建模-kyverno-gatekeeper"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：策略是「可执行契约」，不是检查清单","id":"核心概念-策略是-可执行契约-不是检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"选型：四类实现的能力边界","id":"选型-四类实现的能力边界"},{"level":2,"text":"策略阶梯：从标签规范到溯源强制","id":"策略阶梯-从标签规范到溯源强制"},{"level":2,"text":"失效模式：策略「装了」为什么没生效","id":"失效模式-策略-装了-为什么没生效"},{"level":2,"text":"运营：灰度、例外与策略即代码","id":"运营-灰度-例外与策略即代码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"keyless 身份绑定、Fulcio 与信任根轮换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/container-image-supply-chain-security-sbom-sigstore-slsa/signing-sigstore-slsa/keyless-identity-trust-policy"},"next":{"title":"签名与证明验证门：验证策略绑定与失败处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/container-image-supply-chain-security-sbom-sigstore-slsa/admission-policy-enforcement/signature-attestation-verification-gate"}}